# 8. SUPABASE SECURITY AND RLS

Security requirements:

1. Enable RLS on exposed subscription and entitlement tables.
2. Authenticated users may read only their own permitted subscription and entitlement information.
3. Clients must not insert, update, or delete paid entitlements.
4. Clients must not directly set subscription status to `active`.
5. Clients must not modify product pricing or billing status.
6. Backend privileged operations must use the existing secure server-side Supabase configuration.
7. Never expose the Supabase service-role key in Tauri, Rust, React, Android, desktop builds, or browser bundles.
8. Continue using authenticated Supabase user JWTs for user-owned operations that require RLS.
9. Restrict administrative subscription operations to authorized admin roles.
10. Record administrative entitlement changes in the audit trail.

Do not weaken existing RLS policies while adding subscription functionality.

