- Encrypt retained purchase tokens at rest.
- Use token fingerprints for deduplication.
- Verify the Android package name.
- Verify the product ID and provider state.
- Prevent purchase-token ownership conflicts.
- Handle linked purchase tokens during plan replacement.
- Use authenticated Pub/Sub delivery.
- Apply rate limiting to purchase verification endpoints.
- Validate and sanitize all API inputs.
- Protect webhook endpoints against spoofing and replay.
- Apply strict authorization to administrative endpoints.
- Record subscription lifecycle events.
- Use idempotent purchase and webhook processing.
- Use database transactions for related subscription and entitlement updates.
- Avoid exposing payment-provider secrets or internal diagnostic details to users.

